OL,3,GNEWSAThree men charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder after stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a stabbing in
OL,8,FCounty Antrim.
OL,10,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fsaid a man sustained a number of stab
OL,12,Fwounds following an assault and was
OL,13,Ftaken to hospital for treatment to his
OL,14,Finjuries.
OL,16,FThe incident occurred in the
OL,17,FTemplepatrick Road area of Doagh around
OL,18,F11:10 BST on Thursday.
OL,20,FAll three men, aged 31, 32 and 46, have
OL,21,Fbeen charged with a number of offences
OL,22,Fincluding attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
